#  Nova - Your Personal AI Companion

<div align="center">
  <p><b>A lightweight, zero-storage, multimodal AI companion built with Streamlit, Google GenAI SDK, and Kawaii aesthetics! (•̀ᴗ•́)و</b></p>
</div>

---

##  Features

* ** Kawaii Aesthetic UI:** Designed with a clean pastel interface and expressive kaomojis  throughout headers and chat logs.
* **  Persistent Long-Term Memory:** Save facts about yourself into a local JSON memory bank so Nova remembers who you are across sessions without bloating your system.
* ** Quick Notes Sidebar:** Jot down code snippets, ideas, or to-do lists directly inside the app interface.
* **  Multimodal Vision:** Upload pictures (outfits, food ingredients, plants, code screenshots) and let Nova analyze them instantly.
* **  Speech-to-Text & Text-to-Speech (Voice Loop):** Talk directly to Nova using your microphone (`streamlit-mic-recorder`) and listen to her reply back out loud using dynamic `gTTS` audio synthesis.
* **  Multi-Language Support:** Seamlessly switch between English, Spanish, French, Japanese, Hindi, and German. Nova automatically updates her language for text, speech recognition, and audio responses.
* **  Custom Personalities:** Switch between multiple vibe settings (*Friendly & Casual*, *Witty & Sarcastic Friend*, *Wise Zen Mentor*, *Hyper-Supportive Cheerleader*, and *Strict Coding Coach*).

---

##  Tech Stack

* **Frontend:** [Streamlit](https://streamlit.io/)
* **AI Engine:** Google GenAI SDK (`google-genai` with `gemini-3.6-flash`)
* **Voice Integration:** `gTTS` (Text-to-Speech) & `streamlit-mic-recorder` (Speech-to-Text)
* **Storage:** Lightweight local JSON files (`memory.json`, `notes.json`) for zero cloud/local bloat.

---

##  Getting Started

### 1. Clone or Download the Project
Make sure you have all project files (`app.py`, requirements, etc.) in your local directory.

### 2. Install Dependencies
Run the following command in your terminal to install the required Python packages:
```bash
pip install streamlit google-genai gtts pillow streamlit-mic-recorder
